# predicate/

Test suite for the Riffle predicate evaluation system. Covers core structures and evaluation (Items, Predicates, Type Coercion), composition layers (Loops, Pipelines), caching infrastructure, DSL resolution and registry, and standard library predicates. Includes integration tests and end-to-end workflows.

## Files

- `item_test.exs` -- Item struct: fields, tags, metadata operations
- `coerce_test.exs` -- Type coercion functions (to_integer, to_float, to_text, to_boolean)
- `predicate_test.exs` -- Predicate definition and evaluation
- `cache_test.exs` -- Global Cache GenServer configuration and operations
- `predicate_cache_integration_test.exs` -- Predicate evaluation with cache behavior
- `loop_cache_integration_test.exs` -- Loop processing with cache integration
- `loop_test.exs` -- Loop: applying multiple predicates to items
- `pipeline_test.exs` -- Pipeline: chaining loops and CSV processing
- `default_pipeline_config_test.exs` -- PipelineConfig behavior implementation
- `default_pipeline_resolution_test.exs` -- Predicate resolution via configured module
- `resolver_test.exs` -- Resolver for predicate/loop/pipeline references and cycles
- `registry_test.exs` -- Registry: registering and retrieving definitions
- `standard_lib_test.exs` -- StandardLib predicates (Text, Numeric, Boolean, Date)
- `user_test.exs` -- End-to-end: loading .pred files and processing CSV data
